    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f4858bcf5cd99e520373e21",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我不想把德比视为三冠过程中的\n其中一场GⅠ……\n我真正的目标只有德比。",
      "source_fingerprint": "de0fdaa3791a1e4fea4f1f5720f7c9c44c65bac0b6418c6a293a99607861065e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
