    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc2d46e10d02c8c5fd898df2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若以目前状态挑战“皋月赏”的确令人担忧。\n除了担心受伤、负担过重外，\n要是跑输了还有精神层面受创的风险。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff82344fa19e468445dfb66864c4b94940cfe16c7bc68ce648d7df5e0dd3bf5d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a97a3388c4c522bb9af0404",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过如果将一切全赌在德比，风险也很高",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cd7b0dd23940320ab841d53861418efd410e137d2ef25ea1395a32da7828279",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76c7c378fd98f7d01338cf1d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "每一场比赛都伴随着风险，\n但荒漠英雄的身体发育得还不够成熟，\n要是有个万一想必后果会更加严重。不过──",
      "source_fingerprint": "27bf5bd8896bc891af0c23135172266c112574ffafa2428d4416b57a3b70b66c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85e2dd78ba883f6528ae493e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她在重赏比赛的经验尚浅，\n就这样直接挑战德比太不切实际了。\n我告诉她，若想实现目标还得多经历一场比赛……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f643ff7f22aa9d58d7c1bb7b075040f1a5b1b23e3956359abcfd5a620a3c241e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
